    "name": "Nexapa CRM - WhatsApp & Messaging API",
    "description": "Expanded Postman collection for Nexapa CRM WhatsApp and messaging workflows.\n\nBase URL: https://crm.nexapa.app\n\nCovers:\n- WhatsApp configuration\n- Send / react\n- Templates\n- Media\n- Broadcasts\n- Meta webhook verification & sample events\n- CRM Conversations\n- CRM Messages\n- CRM Contacts\n- CRM Broadcast API\n- CRM Webhook API\n- Quick Replies\n- AI drafting / autoreply support\n- Account / current user checks\n\nImportant:\n- Some request bodies are safe example templates inferred from the active route structure and UI workflows. Adjust fields to match the exact server implementation when needed.\n- Protected endpoints require a valid authenticated CRM session.\n- Do not disable Meta webhook signature verification in production.\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
